stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingFill : Submit sell limit order\n(entry or reopen after rollout)

    PendingFill --> Active : Fill confirmed\n(limit filled or market fallback after timeout)
    PendingFill --> Cancelled : orderFillTimeoutSec elapsed\nCancel + retry at market

    Active --> Active : Tick received\nMid and Greeks refreshed\nDTE countdown continues

    Active --> RollingOut : EvaluateLeg\nActionRollNextMonth\nor ActionRollSameLeg

    Active --> EmergencyClose : EvaluateLeg\nActionStopLoss\nLoss ≥ 200% of premium

    Active --> GammaClose : GammaMonitor\nNet γ < 0\nbull or bear trend

    Active --> KillSwitch : SIGUSR1 received\nor KILL_SWITCH env var

    RollingOut --> Closed : Buy order fills\nLimit→timeout→market\nNew leg opened

    EmergencyClose --> Closed : Buy market fills\nimmediately\nPriority HIGH queue

    GammaClose --> Closed : Buy market fills\nimmediately\nPriority HIGH queue

    KillSwitch --> Closed : Buy market fills\nimmediately\nPriority HIGH queue

    Closed --> [*] : Removed from StateManager\nROI fields written to orders.log

    note right of Active
        Monitored every tick:
        DTE countdown to rolloutDTE
        abs(delta) drift below 0.10
        ROI% >= 50% capture
        Loss% >= 200% stop-loss
    end note
